## The task
Issue NIFI-14556 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Add JSON normalization for Git registry clients
Area: Extensions

The goal is to add a normalization step when converting the registered flow snapshot into a JSON string in order to have consistent items ordering in the arrays. This way, this should minimize the amount of differences when comparing two consecutive versions of the same flow. The diff will be able to better focus on what has really changed.

