Issue NIFI-15244 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Upon damaged journal file, NiFi adds 3 more flowfiles to the queues

Hi team, I'm facing a major issue in my NiFi instance in which when the current journal file becomes damaged, every time NiFi will try to update the journal file and rollback - it ends up adding 3 additional flowfiles to the original queue

