## The task
Issue NIFI-15251 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: UpdateAttribute throws NullPointerException if value set to empty parameter
Area: Extensions

The UpdateAttribute processor throws a NullPointerException if you add a user-defined property whose value is a Parameter and that Parameter is unset.

This is because the ConcurrentHashMap that it attempts to insert into does not support null keys. The processor should be invalid in this case.

