## The task
Issue NIFI-15284 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Add debug logs to Wait/Notify processors
Area: Extensions

Wait/Notify processors may be necessary for some advanced scenarios where the FlowFile Concurrency at Process Group level is not enough. Those processors implement a quite advanced logic and things can be complicated to troubleshoot without being able to see what is stored in the shared cache. This issue is to track the addition of debug log statements in both processors to help better understand what is happening.

