## The task
Issue NIFI-15442 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Migrate Properties for RegistryClients and Parameter Providers
Area: Core Framework

In v 2.7.0, a property was removed from the BitbucketFlowRegistryClient (Bitbucket API Version), rendering any BitbucketFlowRegistryClient invalid after updating NiFi until the property is manually removed.

The migration process would benefit from RegistryClients having the possibility to remove/change properties analog to how ControllerServices and Processor can use the method migrateProperties.

