## The task
Issue NIFI-15448 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Add option for using predefined schemas in GenerateRecord
Area: Extensions

Add the option to use a predefined schema for GenerateRecord. We would add schemas for representing the following objects:
 * Person
 * Order
 * Event
 * Sensor
 * Product
 * Stock Trade
 * Complete Example

The last one is to generate data that includes all supported types in Avro schemas, it can be helpful to quickly test integrations and confirm support with all data types.

This improvement is really to make it super easy to quickly generate some random data instead of expecting the user to provide a schema or add many dynamic properties to the configuration of the processor.

