Issue NIFI-15782 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: ConsumeIMAP and ConsumePOP3 can fail permanently on server connection issues
Area: Extensions

The ConsumeIMAP (and most likely ConsumePOP3) processors enter a permanent failed state when the connection to the email server is interrupted (e.g., network issues, server restarts, timeouts). These processors do not automatically recover from this state, requiring a full NiFi restart to resume email consumption.

