## The task
Issue NIFI-15790 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Batch secret resolution in StandardConnectorConfigurationContext
Area: Core Framework

During connector configuration, each SecretReference property triggers an independent call chain: getSecretProvider() (which validates all parameter providers) followed by provider.getSecrets() (which may fetch all secrets then filters). With batching, all secrets in a step are resolved in one round-trip, and the full re-resolution at start time uses a single call across all steps.

