## The task
Issue NIFI-15872 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Flow version upgrade fails on parameter description change
Area: Flow Versioning

Following change in NIFI-15785, a flow version upgrade where only a parameter description is changing will fail because we are not stopping/disabling the referencing components. Given that a parameter description change has no impact on the running flow, a description change should be ignored during a flow version change.

