## The task
Issue NIFI-16087 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: GitHub Flow Registry fails to retrieve commits when a commit author's GitHub account cannot be resolved
Area: Extensions, Flow Versioning

Retrieving the commit history for a GitHub-versioned flow fails when any commit in that history has an author whose GitHub account cannot be resolved (e.g. the Copilot bot, or a deleted user, which return HTTP 404 on GET /users/<login>). The failure is reproducible on every retrieve/import and surfaces as a misleading error ("Path [<path>] or Branch [refs/heads/<branch>] not found") even though both exist.

