## The task
Issue NIFI-16149 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Controller Service added to a versioned flow is not reported by "Show Local Changes"

When a user adds a Controller Service and references it from a processor property, both the service and the reference are classified as an environmental change and omitted from "Show Local Changes". The fix marks services created by property migration so only those are suppressed, while user-added services are correctly reported as local modifications.

## What this person changed
- NIFI-16149 Handled migration-created Controller Services as environmental changes in Versioned Flows (#11480)
