 # *Remove BufferedInputStream*

Use responseBody.byteStream() directly if mark/reset is not required by the reader.
 # *Configurable Buffer Size*

Introduce a NiFi property to configure the buffer size for streams that require buffering. Default could remain 8 KB, but users may increase it for larger payloads.
