## The task
Issue NIFI-15084 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Confluent REST Schema Registry Client Malformed Authorization Header
Area: Extensions

Following recent refactoring of the RestSchemaRegistryClient for Confluent Schema Registry, the Authorization header is missing the {{Basic}} scheme prefix for the value of the {{Authorization}} header, when configured with a username and password.

The value of {{Authorization}} header must begin with {{Basic}} followed by a space and the Base64 encoded username and password, with semi-colon separator.

