Issue NIFI-15088 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Refactor Login Identity Provider XML Processing
Area: Core Framework

The framework currently loads the login-identity-providers.xml configuration using JAXB with generated classes. This requires a Maven plugin for generating classes from an XSD and runtime dependencies on JAXB. Refactoring the XML loading process for Login Identity Providers using standard DOM objects avoids both build and runtime dependencies on JAXB without introducing significant parsing complexity.

