Following the pattern of recent changes for Login Identity Providers and Authorizations, the File Authorizer implementation with User Group Provider and Access Policy Provider classes should be refactored from using JAXB to DOM for XML parsing. As with other refactoring, this change will remove the need for build plugins to generate Java classes from XML Schema Documents and will also remove runtime dependencies on JAXB for reading and writing XML configuration.

