Issue NIFI-15137 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Upgrade NiFi NAR Maven Plugin to 2.2.0
Area: Core Framework

The NiFi NAR Maven Plugin should be upgraded to 2.2.0 in order to incorporate the addition of Flow Registry Clients as a documented extension.

The upgrade surfaced an issue in the StandardRuntimeManifestBuilder that expects a defined Extension Type from the enumeration of values when building the Runtime Manifest. The Extension Type is null when the value is not one of the enumerated values. Instead of throwing an exception, the Manifest Builder should log and warning and proceed.

