NiFi 2 introduced a redesigned implementation of the bootstrap process that eliminated use of historical socket communication strategies. The {{nifi-framework-api}} includes the BootstrapCommunicator interface and related components that are now specific to MiNiFi and not used elsewhere in the NiFi framework. For this reason, these components should be moved from the {{nifi-framework-api}} to appropriate MiNiFi modules.

## What this person changed
- NIFI-15522 Moved BootstrapCommunicator interface to MiNiFi Framework API
  NIFI-15522 Moved BootstrapCommunicator interface to MiNiFi Framework API

This closes #10823.
