## The task
Issue NIFI-15888 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: NiFI UI freezes and stays unresponsible when opening big content in content-viewer
Area: Core UI

The NiFi UI gets permanently unresponsible with the content-viewer when opening a FlowFile content with bigger size (e.g. 600 MB).

Problem scenario :
The NiFi UI freezes after some Frontend activities working with bigger files. Here i used one file size of 600MB and did : * Open queue list or data provenance and open the (big) content via "View Content" with the content-viewer
 * View Type "hex" limits the displayed content to 10KB. But when i change to "text" or "json" the UI freezes after some time
 * Sometimes the UI recovers after some minutes, sometimes not - then i have to restart some cluster nodes and everything recovers

 
The NiFi API keeps responsive and the flows are still working.
 This was tested with the following environments:
a) NiFi Version 2.8.0 ; Ubuntu linux; Java 21 ; OnPrem One Node Cluster with zookeeper 3.9.3
b) NiFi Version 2.6.0 ; Red Hat Linux ; Java 21 ; three node cluster zookeeper

