- NIFI-16132 Added Component ID to Standard Component Log MDC (#11452)
  NIFI-16132 Added Component ID to Standard Component Log MDC (#11452)

- Renamed SimpleProcessLogger to StandardComponentLog
- Adjusted constructors to require componentId in both cases

