## The task
Issue NIFI-16139 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Add Source and Destination to Connection Status Events
Area: Core Framework

Following the pattern of the Connection Status object defined for the Status History Repository, the Connection Status Event should include fields to identify the Source and Destination associated with the Event. The Component Metric Context provides standard fields for identifying Components, including {{id}} and {{name}}, which should be mapped from the corresponding {{Connectable}} properties.

