## The task
Issue NIFI-16146 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: FileUtils Sanitization incorrect handling for UTF-16 characters
Area: Core Framework

The {{FileUtils}} class supports sanitizing filenames by replacing an enumerated list of characters. The initial implementation does not properly handle UTF-16 characters, such as emojis, which require more than one code point for representation in Java. The sanitization method should be adjusted to handle these characters.

