Issue NIFI-16148 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Align Parameter Context Update Method Authorization
Area: Core Framework, Security

The Parameter Context Resource supporting REST API operations contains several methods for updating an existing Parameter Context. One method supports updating Parameter Context values for stopped components, while the others support submitting an update request and then completing the update request in a subsequent operations. These multiple methods should share the same approach for authorization to ensure consistent behavior.

