## The task
Issue NIFI-16205 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Improve Connector Referenced Component Authorization
Area: Core Framework

Multiple Connector REST API operations reference different types of components during the update process. Most of these components fall under the Connector itself, making the Connector the applicable element for authorization. Other references, such as Assets and Secrets supplied through Parameter Providers should follow standardized authorization handling. This authorization strategy is subject to change in the future based on potential restructuring for framework authorization in general, but for now, Connector referenced values should follow applicable patterns.

