## The task
Issue NIFI-16327 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Trivial)
Title: HC Vault namespace propagation error on non-token Authentication
Area: Extensions

The vault.namespace property was not propagated to login requests for CERT and other non-TOKEN authentication methods, because NIFI-16013 removed the restTemplateBuilder override that added the X-Vault-Namespace  header. Spring Vault 4.1 builds the login VaultClient through that builder, so the login request was sent to the Vault root namespace.

This is a regression introduced in 2.10.0

