## The task
Issue NIFI-11719 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: RecordPath to include math function
Area: Core Framework

Currently [NiFi Record Path |https://nifi.apache.org/docs/nifi-docs/html/record-path-guide.html] doesn't have any mathematical functions exposed

It would be great to have at least following functions:
*  multiply(/field1, /field2)
*  divide(/field1, /field2)
*  add(/field1, /field2)
*  subtract(/field1, /field2)

Current solution is to use QueryRecord, but for simple operations like above - its quite heavy.

Real world scenario:
We have fields: 
- SharePrice in EUR
- FXRate EUR/USD 

We need to get SharePrice in USD.

