+Flow with SplitExcel+

GetFile -> SplitExcel -> ConvertRecord (configured with ExcelReader with Schema Access Strategy 'Use Starting Row' and CSVRecordSetWriter (configured with Schema Access Strategy 'Inherit Record Schema', Date Format MM/dd/yyyy, Time Format HH:mm:ss and Timestamp Format MM/dd/yyyy'T'hh:mm:ss)

