## The task
Issue NIFI-15273 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Improve validation for property WebSocket Message Type in PutWebSocket

Currently there is only non blank validation for the PROP_WS_MESSAGE_TYPE property in PutWebSocket which can lead to a run time exception being thrown if the type entered does not match the values in the WebSocketMessage.Type enum.

The purpose of this ticket is to add validation to ensure only an Expression Language expression is entered or one of the values in the WebSocketMessage.Type enum for property PROP_WS_MESSAGE_TYPE.

