## The task
Issue NIFI-15575 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Add the Javadoc snippet tag for the code examples in the Nifi Javadocs
Area: Core Framework, Extensions

The point of this ticket is replace <pre><code> tags found in the NIFI javadoc with the snippet tag. The snippet tag allows for including actual Java code in the Javadocs without the need to do any escaping. In addition it allows for specifying other languages such as JSON, property files and plain text.

More information regarding the snippet tag can be seen in the following [article|https://blogs.oracle.com/javamagazine/java-javadoc-snippet/].

