Issue NIFI-15716 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Add JSON Lines Support to ValidateJson

In NIFI-15712, JSON Lines support was added to JoltTransformJSON. This ticket addresses the need to add similar support of JSON Lines to ValidateJson.

The current behavior of ValidateJson if it encounters JSON Lines is to only validate the first JSON line but not the rest of the lines. This ticket would address the ability to validate all of the lines.

