## The task
Issue NIFI-16161 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Add the ability to validate Json schemas before use in ValidateJson

Currently if a Json schema is added either as an actual file or text, there is no validation done in the customValidate method hence any issues with the schema are not caught until validation against the JSON is attempted. The purpose of this ticket is to enhance the customValidate method of ValidateJson to validate the schema when its text is readily available.

## What this person changed
- NIFI-16161 Added the ability to validate JSON schemas before use in ValidateJson (#11503)
  NIFI-16161 Added the ability to validate JSON schemas before use in ValidateJson (#11503)
