## The task
Issue NIFI-16162 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Deprecate copy method in org.apache.nifi.stream.io.StreamUtils and replace it with method transferTo from java.io.Inputstream

The {{copy}} method in {{org.apache.nifi.stream.io.StreamUtils can be replaced with java.io.Inputstream}} method {{transferTo(OutputStream out). Hence it should be deprecated. Other methods in org.apache.nifi.stream.io.StreamUtils}} such as skip, {{read and fillBuffer}} will be addressed in subsequent ticket(s).

## What this person changed
- NIFI-16162 Deprecated StreamUtils.copy() and replaced with InputStream.transferTo() (#11521)
