Issue NIFI-16389 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Replace the use of Files.createTempDirectory in unit tests with JUnit5 TempDir

When using Files.createTempDirectory , files are created in /tmp and can pile up over time without being cleaned up. To solve this JUnit5 TempDir should be used so that any directories or files created are cleaned up after use.

