Issue NIFI-14638 (Sub-task, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Allow Stop Version Control regardless of CurrentUser.canVersionFlows

If a Process Group is under version control and the user has permissions to the PG, the should be allowed to stop version control. Currently, it considers whether `canVersionFlows` which is based on the presence of Registry Clients.

