When creating a new dynamic property where the property descriptor contains a default value, the UI does not initialize the form correctly. There are issues in both the combo editor and nf (text) editor. The form should be initialized with the default value and the form should be dirty (since the current value is null).

## What this person changed
- NIFI-14988: Fixing issue with default values for dynamic properties. (#10320)
  NIFI-14988: Fixing issue with default values for dynamic properties. (#10320)

- In the combo editor, the form was not marked as dirty which caused the Apply button to not be enabled.
- In the nf editor, the default value was not considered.

This closes #10320

