## The task
Issue NIFI-14996 (New Feature, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Allow component bulletins to be cleared
Area: Core Framework, Core UI

From a users perspective it would be helpful to be able to clear bulletins on demand. An existing bulletin may be something that is addressable through a configuration change. It would be helpful to support clearing these previous bulletins before running the component again to avoid confusion around whether any bulletins are old or the result of the currently applied configuration.

