## The task
Issue NIFI-14263 (Sub-task, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: UI - Migrate components to standalone
Area: Core UI

Following the Angular 19 upgrade by default all components are standalone. During the initial upgrade there were a few non standalone components that were kept. This Jira is tracking migrating those to be standalone as well.

Currently running lint fix will result in all the {{standalone: false}} entries from being removed.

Many of the component register ngrx features and this cannot happen in a Component due to lifecycle issues [1]. We could still migrate all components that do not register ngrx features.

 [1] [Allow feature registration in standalone components. · ngrx platform · Discussion #4288|https://github.com/[user]/platform/discussions/4288]

