Issue NIFI-14563 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: UI - Inherited parameter contexts don't display in the correct order.
Area: Core UI

When editing a parameter context, if you change the order of inherited parameter contexts and save it, when you come back to the dialog the order is not displayed in the same order as you saved it. However, it appears to only be a UI issue as the parameters are applied in the expected inheritance chain.

 

Also of note, the API call to the backend returns the inherited parameters in the correct order and the UI isn't respecting that order when displaying.

