Issue NIFI-15885 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Occasionally NiFi node fails to complete offload / decommission
Area: Core Framework

Occasionally when a NiFi node is decommissioned, it transitions to 'OFFLOADING' state and never completes. It just gets 'stuck' there, showing that it's still waiting for a few FlowFiles to complete offload. This implies that the stop/terminate is not always properly rolling back the session that have pulled data from queues.

