org.apache.nifi.processor.exception.FlowFileHandlingException: StandardFlowFileRecord[uuid=698f2cfd-e84e-4cc2-8647-d502926cf92a,claim=StandardContentClaim [resourceClaim=StandardResourceClaim[id=1767716178875-1, container=default, section=1], offset=24, length=4],offset=0,name=698f2cfd-e84e-4cc2-8647-d502926cf92a,size=4] is already marked for transfer
	at org.apache.nifi.controller.repository.StandardProcessSession.validateRecordState(StandardProcessSession.java:3703)
