Issue NIFI-14308 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Support optional impersonalization in JsonConfigBasedBoxClientService
Area: Extensions

The current version of JsonConfigBasedBoxClientService [always sets as-user header|https://github.com/apache/nifi/blob/main/nifi-extension-bundles/nifi-box-bundle/nifi-box-services/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/box/controllerservices/JsonConfigBasedBoxClientService.java#L203], which makes the Controller Service unusable without enabled "Make API calls using the as-user header".



The proposal is to make the [Account ID attribute|https://github.com/apache/nifi/blob/main/nifi-extension-bundles/nifi-box-bundle/nifi-box-services/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/box/controllerservices/JsonConfigBasedBoxClientService.java#L60] optional. If it's empty, the as-user header isn't set either.

