## The task
Issue NIFI-14672 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Support duplicate mapped values in replaceByPattern
Area: Core Framework

Currently each {{mappedTo}} value in `replaceByPattern` must be unique. What it means, is that a pattern like this {{a:res,b:res}} won't map both {{a and b}} to {{{}res{}}}.

The function should support mapping to the same value multiple times.
If {{{}str = a{}}}, then {{${str:replaceByPattern('a:res,b:res')}}}  should return {{res}}
If {{{}str = b{}}}, then {{${str:replaceByPattern('a:res,b:res')}}}  should return {{res}}

