## The task
Issue NIFI-15319 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: ConsumeKinesis throttles new records, but buffers are empty

`ConsumeKinesis` processor doesn't accept any new records due to the buffer being full.

However, when reading records from the buffer no records are received.

 

The reason:

