## The task
Issue NIFI-15751 (Task, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Improve VersionedFlowSynchronizer compatibility with Connectors
Area: Core Framework

Connectors should not be synced to new nodes in the NiFi cluster if they are in the process of updating, as the activeFlowConfiguration could be being modified.

If this happens, the VersionedFlowSynchronizer should mark the connector on the incoming NiFi node as invalid. 

A background thread could synchronize invalid Connectors when they are stable.

