Title: Cloned Provenance Events reflect updated Content and Attributes rather than time of clone

When cloned events are viewed in Data Provenance I would expect both the Flow File Content and Attributes to reflect the state of the flow file that was cloned at the time of cloning.  

 

Example in the Python FlowFileTransformProxy [1] a flow file is cloned.  When the cloned flow file leaves the processor the content remains content of the original flow file.

 

