Issue NIFI-15383 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Ensure JDBC Driver is deregistered when it gets loaded in the HikariCPConnectionPool

When the HikariCPConnectionPool loads a Driver it registeres to the DriverManager on class load with many current drivers.  The DriverManager exists in the System Classloader.    This will prevent the InstanceClassLoader that the HikariCPConnectionPool is running in from being Garbage Collected.  

The Driver should be deregistered onRemove to prevent this leak.

