Issue NIFI-15744 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: [Connectors] Ensure Working Flow is Synchronized after working context is discarded

When a connector updates are applied or the working is discarded the active context is copied back to the working context.  However the changes are not applied to the flow until the first step is saved.  This can be problematic if nothing changes in that step as the UI will not be called to update the flow.  So the connector should do this after the working context is changed.

