Title: Add SupportsBatching annotation to OpenPGP and UpdateCounter Processors
Area: Extensions

I experienced a backlog of flowfiles in front of UpdateCounter.  Adding multiple ConcurrentTasks helps, but SupportsBatching helps even more and is more efficient.

I looked through other processors in the codebase and we should add SupportsBatching annotation where it could help improve performance.
 * UpdateCounter
 * CalculateRecordStats
 * DecryptContentPGP
 * EncryptContentPGP
 * SignContentPGP
 * VerifyContentPGP

