## The task
Issue NIFI-14550 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Allow an unversioned PG to start tracking to a version in a registry client

This improvement is to add a new REST API that will allow updating an unversioned PG to be under version control and tracking to an existing flow in a selected registry client. Which is different from Start Version Control which creates a whole new flow in the registry client. A similar analogy might be having a local git repo and adding a remote to track to.

