## The task
Issue NIFI-14785 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: cluster-status command can be broken while upgrading a cluster

In NIFI-14758 we added a new message type to the cluster protocol for fetching node statuses from the cluster coordinator and `bin/nifi.sh cluster-status` now calls this.

This creates an issue if this command is called during a rolling upgrade because the newly upgrade node will make this call to the coordinator, but the coordinator doesn't support this message type yet.

## What this person changed
