## The task
Issue NIFI-15478 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Components referencing assets can be invalid after asset synchronization

When a node joins the cluster it first loads the flow from the coordinator and then synchronizes assets with the coordinator. If a controller service references an asset that wasn't present when the flow was loaded and is then added during synchronization, the service is remaining invalid and never seeing the presence of the asset, even though it is now there. This appears to have started happening after the changes in [NIFI-15267 title|https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/NIFI-15267]

## What this person changed
- NIFI-15478 - Restart components affected by synchronized assets (#10779)
  NIFI-15478 - Restart components affected by synchronized assets (#10779)

