Issue NIFI-15576 (Improvement, In Progress, priority Major)
Title: ConsumeKinesis processor should record LAG in milliseconds as metric and an attribute
Area: Extensions

The *ConsumeKinesis* processor should use 
{code:java}
ProcessSession#recordGuage{code}
 to record a lag in milliseconds for shards being processed. 

The lag value will be fetched from KCL's
{code:java}
ProcessRecordInput#millisBehindLatest
{code}
 

The value should also be added as an attribute to emmited flow files
